nk-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">乳首ビンッ！ビンッ！爆乳スナックママ 肉感ボディ中出し接客で不倫しちゃう僕 宍戸里帆 <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">CJOD00495</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">宍戸里帆</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">痴女ヘブン</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">至近距離密着ピストン＆濃厚フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dcjod00495&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">ドスケベ人妻が精子奪い合いハーレム自宅風俗マンション 彩月七緒 羽月乃蒼 <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">HMN00886</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">彩月七緒, 羽月乃蒼</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">本中</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">至近距離密着ピストン＆濃厚フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dhmn00886&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 作品別徹底詳細レビュー（1作品ずつ長文解説） -->\n  <section class=\"space-y-12\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white\">【完全個別レビュー】厳選収録作品の深層分析＆抜きどころ解説</h3>\