y-between gap-2 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800\">\n        <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-full shadow\">FILE 02</span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-pink-400 tracking-wider\">品番: HNVR00175</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4 class=\"text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-white leading-snug hover:text-pink-400 transition\">【VR】廃業寸前の町銭湯のために文字通り一肌脱いでお客を集める全裸洗体サービスを思いついた銭湯の看板娘。 小栗操</h4>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\">\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 shadow-inner group\">\n            <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/hnvr00175/hnvr00175pl.jpg\" alt=\"【VR】廃業寸前の町銭湯のために文字通り一肌脱いでお客を集める全裸洗体サービスを思いついた銭湯の看板娘。 小栗操\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-3 bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 text-xs space-y-1 text-slate-400 font-mono\">\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">出演女優:</strong> 小栗操</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">メーカー:</strong> 本中</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">レーベル:</strong> 本中-VR</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">参考価格:</strong> 740~</div>\n          </div>\n          <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dhnvr00175&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block w-full text-center py-3 px-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-600 to-rose-600 hover:from-pink-500 hover:to-rose-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition duration-150\">\n            FANZA公式で作品詳細・本編を見る ➔\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-slate-300